            "detailed_description": "Polywings is an indie flying game with short and challenge missions, atmospheric music and low poly graphics.<br />\r\nThe game is currently is on the first development phase. I'm a single developer behind, so your feedback and support is really important for me :)<br />\r\nHope you could help me in making this game bigger and better!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIMPORTANT:<br />\r\nIt only support Keyboard and xBox 360 controller for now. (full controller support will be ready soon)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent content:<br />\r\n-7 missions.<br />\r\n-1 map.<br />\r\n-Atmospheric music<br />\r\n-1 Plane.<br />\r\n-Low poly graphics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI'll improve a lot of aspect of the game: Water, Skybox, Shaders, Maps, Gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe final version will have:<br />\r\n-5 maps.<br />\r\n-History mode.<br />\r\n-Challenges mode.<br />\r\n-Exploration mode.<br />\r\n-Achievements.<br />\r\n-Trading cards.<br />\r\n-Highscores.",
